	"data": "Drive: Elements (sdd1, 7.3 TB NTFS)\n\nDevice: /dev/sdd1 → /run/media/cithoreal/Elements\nSize: 7.3 TB total | 4.8 TB used | 2.6 TB free\nFilesystem: NTFS (external HDD)\nHost: star (USB-connected)\n\nThis is the primary long-term archive drive. It holds the full audio journal source audio, Unity project history, MemoryBase archives, and large video collections.\n\nTop-Level Structure\n\nElements/MemoryBase/ — Detailed (1.4 TB)\n\nThe original personal knowledge base system, predating the current vault.…",
